1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,500
We drove all night to get to the
old house by the lake.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,500
Nobody had lived there since
Margaret left in the spring.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:09,800
I asked her brother Thomas
Whitfield about it, and he

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,500
said she had simply given
up on the place.

5
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,000
- Did you bring the keys?
- They're in my bag.

6
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:18,000
<i>The door was open, and the</i>
<i>lights were still on inside.</i>

7
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:21,000
We stood on the porch,
waiting for someone to answer.

8
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:24,000
When nobody came, we went
inside and looked around.

9
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:27,000
Tomorrow morning we
will call the police.
